<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Application Approved</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .credentials { margin: 24px 0; padding: 16px 20px; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 6px; }
      .credentials p { margin: 6px 0; }
      .label { color: #666; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; }
      .value { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Congratulations, Dr. <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Your application to join PH Healthcare System as a doctor has been reviewed and approved.</p>
      <p>You can now log in and start managing your schedule and consultations.</p>
      <% if (password) { %>
      <div class="credentials">
        <p><span class="label">Email</span><br /><span class="value"><%= email %></span></p>
        <p><span class="label">Temporary password</span><br /><span class="value"><%= password %></span></p>
        <p>You will be asked to set a new password right after your first login. Please change it and keep it private.</p>
      </div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="footer">&copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>